{"arm": "vs", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "i": 5, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Tidal editorial: warm paper-cream background, high-contrast serif headlines, thin tide-line dividers, and a calm, readable long-form rhythm", "probability": 0.3}, {"direction": "Product-first Swiss grid: a large, interactive-looking week calendar as the hero visual, with strict sans-serif type and a rigid 12-column layout", "probability": 0.25}, {"direction": "Night-mode focus: deep indigo surfaces, soft glowing accents, and minimal chrome that makes the page feel like a quiet late-evening planning session", "probability": 0.15}, {"direction": "Neo-brutalist raw: monospace type, thick black borders, hard shadows, no border radius, and a loud, deliberately unpolished feel", "probability": 0.1}, {"direction": "Playful sticker collage: pastel color blocks, slightly rotated cards, and friendly rounded shapes that make planning feel light and social", "probability": 0.2}], "pick": {"direction": "Tidal editorial: warm paper-cream background, high-contrast serif headlines, thin tide-line dividers, and a calm, readable long-form rhythm", "probability": 0.3}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Tidepool: Plan your week together</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tidepool helps small teams plan their week together, calmly and in writing, before the week begins.\">\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --paper: #f4ecdc;\n    --paper-deep: #ebe0c8;\n    --paper-light: #faf5ea;\n    --ink: #1c1915;\n    --ink-soft: #4a4339;\n    --ink-faint: #8a8070;\n    --tide: #2c5a5e;\n    --tide-light: #7fa29d;\n    --rust: #a84f2a;\n    --rule: rgba(28, 25, 21, 0.16);\n    --serif-display: \"Didot\", \"Bodoni 72\", \"Bodoni MT\", \"Playfair Display\", Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --serif-text: \"Iowan Old Style\", \"Palatino Linotype\", Palatino, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    --measure: 36rem;\n    --wide: 72rem;\n  }\n\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n  body {\n    background: var(--paper);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--serif-text);\n    font-size: 1.1875rem;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n  }\n\n  ::selection { background: var(--tide-light); color: var(--paper-light); }\n\n  a { color: inherit; }\n\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: var(--wide);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 1.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .column {\n    max-width: var(--measure);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Type ---------- */\n\n  .display, h1, h2, h3 {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 7.2vw, 5.6rem);\n    line-height: 0.98;\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  }\n\n  h1 em, h2 em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.4vw, 3.3rem);\n    line-height: 1.04;\n  }\n\n  h3 {\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.74rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.7rem;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    width: 2.2rem;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: currentColor;\n  }\n\n  .lede {\n    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  p + p { margin-top: 1.25em; }\n\n  .muted { color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  .small {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Tide-line dividers ---------- */\n\n  .tideline {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 22px;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    opacity: 0.55;\n  }\n\n  .tideline--flip { transform: scaleY(-1); }\n\n  .tide-rule {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: var(--wide);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 1.5rem;\n    color: var(--tide);\n  }\n\n  .tide-rule svg { width: 100%; height: 18px; display: block; }\n\n  section { position: relative; }\n\n  .section {\n    padding: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 8.5rem) 0;\n  }\n\n  .section--tint {\n    background: var(--paper-deep);\n  }\n\n  .section-head {\n    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);\n  }\n\n  .section-head h2 { margin-top: 1rem; }\n\n  .section-head p {\n    margin-top: 1.25rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n\n  header.top {\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 10;\n    background: rgba(244, 236, 220, 0.92);\n    backdrop-filter: saturate(1.2) blur(6px);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(1.2) blur(6px);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n\n  .top-inner {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    height: 4.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .wordmark {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    font-style: italic;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.55rem;\n  }\n\n  .wordmark svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; color: var(--tide); }\n\n  nav.links {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 2rem;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n  }\n\n  nav.links a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  nav.links a:hover { color: var(--tide); }\n\n  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */\n\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.45rem;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ink);\n    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n  }\n\n  .btn--solid {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--paper-light);\n  }\n\n  .btn--solid:hover {\n    background: var(--tide);\n    border-color: var(--tide);\n  }\n\n  .btn--ghost {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  .btn--ghost:hover {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--paper-light);\n  }\n\n  .btn--small {\n    padding: 0.55rem 1.05rem;\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n  }\n\n  .link-arrow {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  .link-arrow:hover { border-color: var(--tide); color: var(--tide); }\n\n  .actions {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 2.5rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n\n  .hero {\n    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 7.5rem) 0 clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);\n  }\n\n  .hero h1 { margin: 1.5rem 0 1.75rem; }\n\n  .hero .lede { max-width: 33rem; }\n\n  .hero-meta {\n    margin-top: 3.5rem;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding-top: 1.5rem;\n    max-width: 40rem;\n  }\n\n  .hero-meta dt {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n  }\n\n  .hero-meta dd {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    margin-top: 0.25rem;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Week board mockup ---------- */\n\n  .board-wrap {\n    padding: 0 0 clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);\n  }\n\n  .board {\n    background: var(--paper-light);\n    border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(28,25,21,0.04), 0 24px 48px -28px rgba(44,90,94,0.35);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .board-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    padding: 1.1rem 1.5rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  .board-bar strong {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  .board-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n  }\n\n  .day {\n    padding: 1.1rem 1rem 1.4rem;\n    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    min-height: 16rem;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .day:last-child { border-right: none; }\n\n  .day-name {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 1.35rem;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n  }\n\n  .day-name span {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  }\n\n  .tide-meter {\n    margin: 0.9rem 0 1rem;\n    height: 22px;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    opacity: 0.7;\n  }\n\n  .task {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    border-left: 2px solid var(--tide-light);\n    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  .task b {\n    display: block;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 0.1rem;\n  }\n\n  .task small {\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n  }\n\n  .task--rust { border-left-color: var(--rust); }\n  .task--ink { border-left-color: var(--ink); }\n\n  .board-foot {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    background: var(--paper);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  .avatars { display: flex; gap: 0; }\n\n  .avatars span {\n    width: 1.9rem;\n    height: 1.9rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid var(--paper-light);\n    margin-left: -0.45rem;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--paper-light);\n  }\n\n  .avatars span:first-child { margin-left: 0; }\n  .av1 { background: var(--tide); }\n  .av2 { background: var(--rust); }\n  .av3 { background: var(--ink); }\n  .av4 { background: var(--tide-light); }\n\n  /* ---------- Long-form essay ---------- */\n\n  .essay p {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    line-height: 1.78;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  .essay p + p { margin-top: 1.4em; }\n\n  .essay .dropcap::first-letter {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    float: left;\n    font-size: 4.6rem;\n    line-height: 0.82;\n    padding: 0.42rem 0.6rem 0 0;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .pullquote {\n    margin: 3.5rem 0;\n    padding: 2.25rem 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--tide);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tide);\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.2vw, 2.25rem);\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .pullquote cite {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Principles ---------- */\n\n  .principles {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n\n  .principle {\n    padding: 2.25rem 2rem 0 0;\n    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    margin-right: 2rem;\n  }\n\n  .principle:last-child { border-right: none; margin-right: 0; }\n\n  .principle .num {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 2.4rem;\n    color: var(--rust);\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .principle h3 { margin: 1rem 0 0.75rem; }\n\n  .principle p {\n    font-size: 1.02rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Process (tide timeline) ---------- */\n\n  .process {\n    list-style: none;\n    position: relative;\n    max-width: var(--measure);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .process::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 1.15rem;\n    top: 0.5rem;\n    bottom: 0.5rem;\n    width: 1px;\n    background: var(--tide-light);\n  }\n\n  .process li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 0 0 3.25rem 4.25rem;\n  }\n\n  .process li:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }\n\n  .process .dot {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0.55rem;\n    top: 0.25rem;\n    width: 1.2rem;\n    height: 1.2rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    border: 1px solid var(--tide);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .process .dot::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    width: 0.4rem;\n    height: 0.4rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--tide);\n  }\n\n  .process .time {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.74rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--tide);\n  }\n\n  .process h3 { margin: 0.4rem 0 0.6rem; }\n\n  .process p {\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Testimonial ---------- */\n\n  .testimony {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .testimony blockquote {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);\n    line-height: 1.28;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    text-indent: -0.45em;\n  }\n\n  .testimony footer {\n    margin-top: 1.75rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  .testimony footer strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* ---------- Pricing ---------- */\n\n  .tiers {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n\n  .tier {\n    background: var(--paper-light);\n    border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding: 2.25rem 2rem 2rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .tier--featured {\n    border-color: var(--tide);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--tide) inset;\n    background: #fdf9f0;\n  }\n\n  .tier .tag {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .tier h3 { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 500; }\n\n  .price {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 3rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 1.25rem 0 0.25rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n\n  .price small {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .tier ul {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding-top: 1.25rem;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .tier li {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: 0.45rem 0 0.45rem 1.4rem;\n    position: relative;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  .tier li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0.95rem;\n    width: 0.7rem;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: var(--tide);\n  }\n\n  .tier .btn { text-align: center; }\n\n  /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */\n\n  .faq details {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding: 1.4rem 0;\n  }\n\n  .faq details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }\n\n  .faq summary {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n\n  .faq summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    color: var(--tide);\n    transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .faq details[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n\n  .faq details p {\n    margin-top: 0.9rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    max-width: 34rem;\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- */\n\n  .closing {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 8rem) 0;\n  }\n\n  .closing h2 { max-width: 16ch; margin: 1.25rem auto 0; }\n\n  .closing p {\n    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;\n    max-width: 30rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n\n  .closing .actions { justify-content: center; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n\n  footer.site {\n    padding: 3rem 0 3.5rem;\n    background: var(--paper-deep);\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n\n  .foot-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 2rem;\n  }\n\n  .foot-grid h4 {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;\n  }\n\n  .foot-grid a {\n    display: block;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.92rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    padding: 0.2rem 0;\n  }\n\n  .foot-grid a:hover { color: var(--tide); }\n\n  .foot-brand p {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    max-width: 18rem;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  .foot-base {\n    margin-top: 3rem;\n    padding-top: 1.5rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */\n\n  @media (max-width: 960px) {\n    .board-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(150px, 1fr)); overflow-x: auto; }\n    .board { overflow-x: auto; }\n    .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .principle {\n      border-right: none;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      margin-right: 0;\n      padding: 2rem 0;\n    }\n    .principle:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n    .tiers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 30rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n    .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 720px) {\n    body { font-size: 1.125rem; }\n    nav.links a:not(.btn) { display: none; }\n    .hero-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }\n    .essay .dropcap::first-letter { font-size: 3.6rem; }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n    * { transition: none !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->\n<header class=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap top-inner\">\n    <a href=\"#top\" class=\"wordmark\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M2 9c2.5-2 4.5-2 7 0s4.5 2 7 0 3-1.5 6-1\" />\n        <path d=\"M2 15c2.5-2 4.5-2 7 0s4.5 2 7 0 3-1.5 6-1\" />\n        <path d=\"M2 21c2.5-2 4.5-2 7 0s4.5 2 7 0 3-1.5 6-1\" opacity=\"0.5\" />\n      </svg>\n      Tidepool\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"links\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n      <a href=\"#method\">Method</a>\n      <a href=\"#principles\">Principles</a>\n      <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a>\n      <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn--solid btn--small\">Start a week</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"top\">\n\n<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"column\" style=\"max-width: 46rem;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">For teams of three to nine</span>\n      <h1>Plan the week together, <em>before</em> the tide comes in.</h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Tidepool gives small teams a quiet, shared place to set the week's priorities, see who is carrying what, and write down the one thing that matters most, all before Monday arrives and the week starts making its own decisions.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn--solid\">Plan your first week</a>\n        <a href=\"#method\" class=\"link-arrow\">Read how it works &rarr;</a>\n      </div>\n      <dl class=\"hero-meta\">\n        <div>\n          <dt>Average planning time</dt>\n          <dd>Twenty-five minutes</dd>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <dt>Setup</dt>\n          <dd>Under two minutes</dd>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <dt>Works with</dt>\n          <dd>Any calendar</dd>\n        </div>\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"tide-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 18\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n    <path d=\"M0 9 C 60 1, 120 1, 180 9 S 300 17, 360 9 S 480 1, 540 9 S 660 17, 720 9 S 840 1, 900 9 S 1020 17, 1080 9 S 1170 1, 1200 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n  </svg>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============ BOARD MOCKUP ============ -->\n<section class=\"board-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"board\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Example weekly plan showing five days with shared tasks and a team load indicator\">\n      <div class=\"board-bar\">\n        <strong>Week of March 9</strong>\n        <span>Four people &middot; Goal set Sunday evening</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"board-grid\">\n        <div class=\"day\">\n          <div class=\"day-name\">Mon <span>09</span></div>\n          <svg class=\"tide-meter\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 22\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 11 C 15 3, 30 3, 40 11 S 65 19, 80 11 S 105 3, 120 11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg>\n          <div class=\"task\"><b>Ship pricing copy</b><small>Mara &middot; 2 focus blocks</small></div>\n          <div class=\"task\"><b>Client kickoff</b><small>Whole team &middot; 10:00</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"day\">\n          <div class=\"day-name\">Tue <span>10</span></div>\n          <svg class=\"tide-meter\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 22\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 11 C 15 3, 30 3, 40 11 S 65 19, 80 11 S 105 3, 120 11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg>\n          <div class=\"task task--ink\"><b>Interview notes</b><small>Jonah &middot; no meetings</small></div>\n          <div class=\"task\"><b>Review onboarding flow</b><small>Priya &middot; 1 hr</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"day\">\n          <div class=\"day-name\">Wed <span>11</span></div>\n          <svg class=\"tide-meter\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 22\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 11 C 15 19, 30 19, 40 11 S 65 3, 80 11 S 105 19, 120 11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg>\n          <div class=\"task task--rust\"><b>Launch blocker</b><small>Dev &middot; needs two owners</small></div>\n          <div class=\"task\"><b>Retro, 30 min</b><small>Whole team</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"day\">\n          <div class=\"day-name\">Thu <span>12</span></div>\n          <svg class=\"tide-meter\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 22\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 11 C 15 19, 30 19, 40 11 S 65 3, 80 11 S 105 19, 120 11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg>\n          <div class=\"task\"><b>Draft case study</b><small>Mara &middot; 3 hrs</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"day\">\n          <div class=\"day-name\">Fri <span>13</span></div>\n          <svg class=\"tide-meter\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 22\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 11 C 15 11, 30 11, 40 11 S 65 11, 80 11 S 105 11, 120 11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg>\n          <div class=\"task\"><b>Written week close</b><small>Everyone &middot; 15 min</small></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"board-foot\">\n        <span>Shared intent: <em>ship pricing, unblock launch</em></span>\n        <div class=\"avatars\" aria-label=\"Team members\">\n          <span class=\"av1\">MA</span><span class=\"av2\">JO</span><span class=\"av3\">PR</span><span class=\"av4\">DK</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ ESSAY ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"method\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"column essay\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">The method</span>\n      <h2 style=\"margin: 1.25rem 0 2.5rem;\">A week is easier to <em>keep</em> when it is agreed on first.</h2>\n\n      <p class=\"dropcap\">Most small teams do not have a planning problem so much as a timing problem. The week arrives in pieces. A request lands on Tuesday, a client calls on Wednesday, and by Thursday everyone is quietly rebuilding a plan that nobody actually wrote down. The result is not chaos exactly. It is a slow drift, and the drift is tiring in a way that is hard to name.</p>\n\n      <p>Tidepool takes a different view. It treats planning as a shared act that happens at a fixed, calm moment, usually Sunday evening or Monday morning, and it asks each person to say three things: what they will finish, what they need from someone else, and what they will not take on. Those statements sit side by side on one page, so that the team can see the week as a whole before it begins.</p>\n\n      <p>Nothing about this is revolutionary. It is closer to what a good editor does with a publication calendar: a clear sense of what goes out, in what order, and who is responsible for each piece. The difference is that the editor is the whole team, and the calendar is open to everyone.</p>\n\n      <blockquote class=\"pullquote\">\n        \"The point of a plan is not to predict the week. It is to agree, out loud, on what the week is for.\"\n        <cite>From the Tidepool field guide</cite>\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <p>Because the plan is written in advance, the middle of the week gets quieter. When something new arrives, the question is no longer \"what should we do?\" but \"does this change what we already agreed?\" That single shift tends to save more time than any amount of scheduling software.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"tide-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 18\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n    <path d=\"M0 9 C 60 1, 120 1, 180 9 S 300 17, 360 9 S 480 1, 540 9 S 660 17, 720 9 S 840 1, 900 9 S 1020 17, 1080 9 S 1170 1, 1200 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n  </svg>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============ PRINCIPLES ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"principles\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head column\" style=\"text-align:left; max-width: 44rem;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Principles</span>\n      <h2>Three habits that keep the <em>shore</em> in view.</h2>\n      <p>Tidepool is built around a small set of commitments. They are deliberately few, and each one is there to protect attention rather than to add a new thing to track.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"principles\">\n      <article class=\"principle\">\n        <div class=\"num\">i.</div>\n        <h3>Start from commitments, not wishes</h3>\n        <p>Every item on the weekly page must have an owner and a rough size. A task without a name is a hope, and hopes do not get finished. Tidepool nudges people to replace \"look into\" with a verb and a deadline.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"principle\">\n        <div class=\"num\">ii.</div>\n        <h3>Name one thing that matters most</h3>\n        <p>Each week gets a single shared intent. When two requests compete for time, the intent decides. It is written in plain language, visible to everyone, and short enough to remember on a Wednesday afternoon.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"principle\">\n        <div class=\"num\">iii.</div>\n        <h3>Close the week in writing</h3>\n        <p>Fifteen minutes on Friday, a few lines per person: what moved, what slipped, and why. The close becomes the opening of next week's plan, so that the team learns from its own calendar rather than from memory.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ PROCESS ============ -->\n<section class=\"section section--tint\" id=\"process\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head column\" style=\"text-align:left; max-width: 44rem;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">The rhythm</span>\n      <h2>One planning tide, <em>every</em> week.</h2>\n      <p>The rhythm is the product. Tidepool keeps a steady cadence so the planning feels like a habit rather than a meeting.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <ol class=\"process\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <div class=\"time\">Sunday, 20 minutes</div>\n        <h3>Each person drafts their week</h3>\n        <p>Before anyone meets, every teammate fills in their own column: what they will finish, what they are waiting on, and what they are declining. Drafting alone keeps the first pass honest.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <div class=\"time\">Monday, 25 minutes</div>\n        <h3>The team reads the whole shore</h3>\n        <p>The shared board shows every column side by side. Overlaps, gaps, and overloads are visible at a glance. The group agrees on the week's single intent and settles any conflicts in the open.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <div class=\"time\">Midweek, as needed</div>\n        <h3>Adjust with a visible tide line</h3>\n        <p>When something changes, you move the item and leave a short note. The board remembers what was planned, so a change is a decision you can point to rather than a surprise.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <div class=\"time\">Friday, 15 minutes</div>\n        <h3>Close the week and carry it forward</h3>\n        <p>Each person writes a brief close. Unfinished items roll into the next week with their reasons attached. The plan for next week begins with what this week taught.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ TESTIMONIAL ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"column testimony\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">From a five-person studio</span>\n      <blockquote style=\"margin-top: 1.75rem;\">\n        We used to spend Monday mornings asking what everyone was doing. Now we spend that time doing it. The only meeting we still hold is the one where we agree on the week.\n      </blockquote>\n      <footer><strong>Dana Okafor</strong>, operations lead, a small design practice</footer>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"tide-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 18\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n    <path d=\"M0 9 C 60 1, 120 1, 180 9 S 300 17, 360 9 S 480 1, 540 9 S 660 17, 720 9 S 840 1, 900 9 S 1020 17, 1080 9 S 1170 1, 1200 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n  </svg>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============ PRICING ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"pricing\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head column\" style=\"text-align:left; max-width: 44rem;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</span>\n      <h2>Begin small. Grow <em>with</em> the team.</h2>\n      <p>Pricing is per workspace, billed monthly, with no seat counts to juggle. Every plan includes the full weekly rhythm.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tiers\">\n      <div class=\"tier\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">Starter</span>\n        <h3>Shallows</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">Free <small>for up to three people</small></div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>One active workspace</li>\n          <li>Weekly board and shared intent</li>\n          <li>Friday close notes</li>\n          <li>Thirty days of history</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn--ghost\">Start free</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"tier tier--featured\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">Most teams</span>\n        <h3>Tidewater</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">$6 <small>per person, per month</small></div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Up to nine people per workspace</li>\n          <li>Midweek adjustment log</li>\n          <li>Carry-forward and roll-over rules</li>\n          <li>Calendar sync, read-only</li>\n          <li>Full history and exports</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn--solid\">Plan with Tidewater</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"tier\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">Larger groups</span>\n        <h3>Open Sea</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">Talk to us <small>for ten or more</small></div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Multiple linked workspaces</li>\n          <li>Admin roles and guest access</li>\n          <li>Single sign-on</li>\n          <li>A short onboarding walkthrough</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn--ghost\">Get in touch</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->\n<section class=\"section section--tint\" id=\"questions\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>\n      <h2 style=\"margin: 1.25rem 0 2.5rem;\">What people ask <em>before</em> they begin.</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details open>\n          <summary>Does this replace our calendar or project tool?</summary>\n          <p>No. Tidepool sits alongside them. It reads your calendar in a limited, read-only way and keeps the weekly intent and commitments in one place. Your tasks can stay where they are; Tidepool simply asks what this week is for.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>How long does the first plan take?</summary>\n          <p>Usually under half an hour, including setup. The first Monday tends to be the longest, because the team is learning to write commitments rather than hopes. Most teams find the second week takes less than twenty-five minutes.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>What if someone is out, or the week falls apart midway?</summary>\n          <p>Absences can be marked on the board, and their items roll forward or reassign with one action. When a week goes off course, the midweek adjustment log keeps a record of what changed and why, which makes the Friday close far more useful.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Is anything shared outside our team?</summary>\n          <p>Workspaces are private by default and visible only to invited members. We do not sell planning data or use it to train models. You can export or delete your workspace at any time.</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ CLOSING CTA ============ -->\n<section class=\"closing\" id=\"start\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Begin</span>\n    <h2>Set the week down before it <em>sets</em> you.</h2>\n    <p>Open a workspace in under two minutes. Invite your team, write the first intent, and see what Monday looks like when everyone already knows.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <a href=\"#top\" class=\"btn btn--solid\">Create a workspace</a>\n      <a href=\"#method\" class=\"link-arrow\">Read the method again &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->\n<footer class=\"site\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"foot-grid\">\n      <div class=\"foot-brand\">\n        <p>Tidepool</p>\n        <p class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:1rem; font-style:normal; font-family: var(--sans); color: var(--ink-faint);\">A quiet place to plan the week, together.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Product</h4>\n        <a href=\"#method\">Method</a>\n        <a href=\"#principles\">Principles</a>\n        <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Company</h4>\n        <a href=\"#top\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"#top\">Journal</a>\n        <a href=\"#top\">Contact</a>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Help</h4>\n        <a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a>\n        <a href=\"#top\">Privacy</a>\n        <a href=\"#top\">Terms</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot-base\">\n      <span class=\"small\">&copy; 2025 Tidepool. All rights reserved.</span>\n      <span class=\"small\">Made for teams that would rather plan than react.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}